== Trivia ==
* The existence of this item suggests that the way Isaac’s father left his {{E|Mom}} as seen in {{s|Chest}}'s ending ([[Endings#Ending 14|Ending 14]]) could have been through a divorce.
** [https://foursouls.com/cards/fsp2-divorce_papers/ A more detailed rendition of Divorce Papers can be found in The Binding of Isaac: Four Souls Card Game]. The papers are signed by Isaac's mother, but not his father, implying that a divorce was filed but the process was left incomplete.
*** {{dlc|r}} The details of the split can be discerned via the dialogue that plays during [[Ascent]], as well as [[Endings#Ending 22|Ending 22]].

